<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Reckitt cut at SBC Warburg.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Reckitt cut at SBC Warburg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>British household goods group Reckitt &amp; Colman Plc was cut to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;add&quot; at SBC Warburg, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>Reckitt shares have risen sharply in recent sessions amid talk of a bid from Unilever Plc, which put its speciality chemical arm up for sale and said it wanted to focus on expanding its consumer goods operations.</p>
<p>Reckitt shares were up 2-1/2p at 816-1/2 by 1255 GMT while Unilever was up 25p at 16.47-1/2.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
